<title>USA: Wilson School District, Pa., final details.</title>
<headline>Wilson School District, Pa., final details.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hamilton Consulting, Inc, financial advisor to Wilson School District, Pa., said it recalculated PaineWebber Inc's winning bid for the District's $34 million general obligation bond sale.  The true interest cost is 5.46 percent reflecting the cost of insurance, not the 5.44 percent originally calculated.</p>
</text>
